menu "Touch check"

choice TOUCH_CHECK_BOARD
    prompt "Board"
    default TOUCH_CHECK_BOARD_JC4827W543
    help
        The board the check runs on: its display, its touch panel and the display's size in millimetres
        come from its file, main/board_<name>.c. The board's drivers of DGX are selected here; the chip
        and its PSRAM come from sdkconfig.defaults.<target>.

config TOUCH_CHECK_BOARD_JC4827W543
    bool "Guition JC4827W543, 4.3\" (ESP32-S3): NV3041A 480x272 on QSPI, GT911"
    select DGX_ENABLE_SPI
    select DGX_ENABLE_NV3041A
    select DGX_ENABLE_VSCREEN

endchoice

endmenu
